OL,3,GNEWSAMan detained for stabbing dog
OL,4,Awalker to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed a dog walker and
OL,7,Fattacked two other people in a "frenzy
OL,8,Fof violence" in west London has been
OL,9,Fgiven an indefinite hospital order for
OL,10,Fmanslaughter.
OL,12,FDawood Safi, 28, fatally stabbed Wayne
OL,13,FBroadhurst, 49, in the street during a
OL,14,Fseries of knife attacks which began at
OL,15,FSafi's home in Uxbridge on 27 October
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FSafi, who was having paranoid delusions
OL,19,Fand hearing voices, attacked his
OL,20,Flandlord Shahzad Farrukh minutes before
OL,21,Fkilling Broadhurst, and also stabbed a
OL,22,F14-year-old boy.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
