OL,3,GNEWSAMan detained for stabbing dog
OL,4,Awalker to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Southwark Crown Court, Mrs Justice
OL,7,FCutts said Safi, an Afghan refugee, had
OL,8,Fbeen "in a psychotic state" and
OL,9,Frecommended that he be deported, but
OL,10,Fsaid the final decision rested with the
OL,11,FHome Secretary.
